The distances is a list of 2, 1, 1, and 2.
The xs is an empty list of whole numbers.
The ys is an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 0 into xs.
Place 0 into ys.
The horiz is 0.
The vert is 0.
The crossed is 0.
For every step from 0 to 3.
The direction is step modulo 4.
The length is item step of distances.
If direction is 0, set vert to vert plus length.
If direction is 1, set horiz to horiz minus length.
If direction is 2, set vert to vert minus length.
If direction is 3, set horiz to horiz plus length.
Place horiz into xs.
Place vert into ys.
The here is step plus 1.
The alox is the smaller of item step of xs and item here of xs.
The ahix is the larger of item step of xs and item here of xs.
The aloy is the smaller of item step of ys and item here of ys.
The ahiy is the larger of item step of ys and item here of ys.
For every other from 0 to step.
If other is less than step minus 1 and crossed is 0.
The blox is the smaller of item other of xs and item (other plus 1) of xs.
The bhix is the larger of item other of xs and item (other plus 1) of xs.
The bloy is the smaller of item other of ys and item (other plus 1) of ys.
The bhiy is the larger of item other of ys and item (other plus 1) of ys.
If ahix is at least blox and bhix is at least alox and ahiy is at least bloy and bhiy is at least aloy, set crossed to 1.

If crossed is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
